  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be pretty sweet if the world could read the rating of an avatar.\n\nMy use case would be to calculate and display to all users what the ratio of Very Poor avatars in the instance is. I believe more visibility into aggregate stats about the users in the world can help people internalize what is to blame for poor performance in any given situation.",
